   Pamungkas, EW (Corresponding Author), Univ Muhammadiyah Surakarta, Social Informat Res Ctr, Surakarta, Indonesia.
   Pamungkas, Endang Wahyu; Fatmawati, Azizah, Univ Muhammadiyah Surakarta, Informat Engn Dept, Surakarta, Indonesia.
   Putri, Divi Galih Prasetyo, Univ Gadjah Mada, Vocat Sch, Software Engn Dept, Yogyakarta, Indonesia.
   Pamungkas, Endang Wahyu, Univ Muhammadiyah Surakarta, Social Informat Res Ctr, Surakarta, Indonesia.},
ISSN = {2158-107X},
