Abstract = {This paper describes our participation in SemEval-2020 Task 12:
   Multilingual Offensive Language Detection. We jointly-trained a single
   model by fine-tuning Multilingual BERT to tackle the task across all the
   proposed languages: English, Danish, Turkish, Greek and Arabic. Our
   single model had competitive results, with a performance close to
