Abstract = {This paper describes the approach of team CENTamil used for abusive
   comment detection in Tamil. This task aims to identify whether a given
   comment contains abusive comments. We used TF-IDF with char-wb analyzers
   with Random Kitchen Sink (RKS) algorithm to create feature vectors and
   the Support Vector Machine (SVM) classifier with polynomial kernel for
