Abstract = {The paper presents a system developed for the SemEval-2020 competition
   Task 12 (OffensEval-2): Multilingual Offensive Language Identification
   in Social Media. We achieve the second place (2nd) in sub-task B:
   Automatic categorization of offense types and are ranked 55th with a
   macro F1-score of 90.59 in sub-task A: Offensive language
   identification. Our solution is using a stack of BERT and LSTM layers,
