Abstract = {Current research on hate speech analysis is typically oriented towards
   monolingual and single classification tasks. In this paper, we present a
   new multilingual multi-aspect hate speech analysis dataset and use it to
   test the current state-of-the-art multilingual multitask learning
   approaches. We evaluate our dataset in various classification settings,
   then we discuss how to leverage our annotations in order to improve hate
