Abstract = {Incivility detection is an important task to identify offensive language
   on online social media platforms. Sentiment analysis is an essential
   task of natural language processing to identify the emotions of given
   sentences. In this demonstration, we propose an online processing
   system, called Oasis, to perform incivility detection and sentiment
