Abstract = {We introduce an approach to multilingual Offensive Language Detection
   based on the mBERT transformer model. We download extra training data
   from Twitter in English, Danish, and Turkish, and use it to re-train the
   model. We then fine-tuned the model on the provided training data and,
   in some configurations, implement transfer learning approach exploiting
   the typological relatedness between English and Danish. Our systems
   obtained good results across the three languages (.9036 for EN,.7619 for
   DA, and.7789 for TR).},
